title: Media and Campaigns
subtitle: The party press, its format, and one campaign to chosen voters.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_media.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.partyReady(Q) && Q.S.chapter.status !== 'ended' !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.media (technical reference 5.3, 10.6, 13.2; card catalogue 5.3): one variant, 1 T and 1 R each;
// the card has no cooldown of its own, a repeated topic loses strength by saturation (Z — 0.34).
PolishParty.mediaView(Q);
Q.pl_media_kind = '';
Q.pl_media_topic = '';
!}

= Media and campaigns

Party press: [+ pl_party_press +]. Party money: [+ pl_party_cash +]. A campaign moves voters only in the cells it reaches; a topic repeated within six months among the same voters gains less.

- @distribution
- @format
- @campaign
- @unions_campaign
- @polemic
- @turnout
- @investigation
- @easy_discard

@distribution
title: Extend the distribution of the press
subtitle: 1 resource; the press reaches more readers (+10, up to 100). Waits two months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressDistributionStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_distribution_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressDistribution(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@format
title: Change the format of the press to [+ pl_media_format_next +]
subtitle: 1 resource. A popular format: the press reaches more people (+10) but loses credibility (−5), and with a wide reach it earns from sales (0.10 resources a month at reach 50 or more); the first adoption raises Centrum dissent (+3). Waits six months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressFormatStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_format_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressFormatChoose(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@campaign
title: A press campaign on a topic
subtitle: 1 resource; reach from the unions, the press and the party's own base; the credibility of the press multiplies it.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.campaignStatus(Q, 'press').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_campaign_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_kind = 'press';
!}
go-to: topics

@unions_campaign
title: A campaign through the unions and meetings
subtitle: 1 resource; the reach of the matching union branch, no press bonus. Useful when the press is weak or restricted.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.campaignStatus(Q, 'unions').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_unions_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_kind = 'unions';
!}
go-to: topics

@polemic
title: A polemic against our main opponent
subtitle: 1 resource; votes come only from [+ pl_media_addressees +]; the addressee's relation with PPS worsens (−2).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.campaignStatus(Q, 'polemic').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_polemic_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_kind = 'polemic';
PolishParty.audienceView(Q, 'polemic');
!}
go-to: audiences

@turnout
title: A mobilisation campaign
subtitle: 1 resource; more of the chosen voters turn out (+0.04, up to 0.90) until the next election.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.campaignStatus(Q, 'turnout').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_turnout_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_kind = 'turnout';
PolishParty.audienceView(Q, 'turnout');
!}
go-to: audiences

@investigation
title: A press investigation
subtitle: 1 resource; the credibility of the press rises (+4) and the revealed fact is recorded once. No invented scandal.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressInvestigationStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_investigation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressInvestigation(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@topics
new-page: true

= The topic of the campaign

The line of the party multiplies a matching topic when it has an addressee (the direction of PPS).

- @topic_parliamentary
- @topic_class
- @topic_workers_gains
- @topic_democracy
- @polish_party_media: Choose another variant.

@topic_parliamentary
title: Parliamentary socialism
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_topic = 'parliamentary';
PolishParty.audienceView(Q, Q.pl_media_kind, 'parliamentary');
!}
go-to: audiences

@topic_class
title: Independent class politics
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_topic = 'class';
PolishParty.audienceView(Q, Q.pl_media_kind, 'class');
!}
go-to: audiences

@topic_workers_gains
title: The defence of workers’ gains
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_topic = 'workers_gains';
PolishParty.audienceView(Q, Q.pl_media_kind, 'workers_gains');
!}
go-to: audiences

@topic_democracy
title: The defence of democracy
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_media_topic = 'democracy';
PolishParty.audienceView(Q, Q.pl_media_kind, 'democracy');
!}
go-to: audiences

@audiences
new-page: true

= To whom?

Choose the voters the campaign speaks to. Nothing is spent until you choose.

- @to_workers
- @to_employed_workers
- @to_unemployed
- @to_old_middle
- @to_new_middle
- @to_rural
- @to_bourgeois_landowners
- @to_major_cities
- @to_jewish
- @to_other_minorities
- @polish_party_media: Choose another variant.

@to_workers
title: To the workers
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.campaignStatus(Q, Q.pl_media_kind, Q.pl_media_topic || undefined, 'workers').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_aud_workers_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.campaign(Q, Q.pl_media_kind, Q.pl_media_topic || undefined, 'workers');
!}
go-to: result

